- ## perihelion
+ ## perihelion

- - `perihelion.Websocket.Error.Reason.Truncated` now renders as "the connection closed before the
-   frame was complete"; its `Communicable` instance previously had no case for it, so describing
-   such an error threw a `MatchError`. (#2439)
+ - `perihelion.Websocket.Error.Reason.Truncated` agora é renderizado como "the connection closed
+   before the frame was complete"; sua instância `Communicable` antes não tinha um caso para ele,
+   de modo que descrever um erro assim lançava um `MatchError`. (#2439)

